{"id":"n64008-1-9","stage":0,"title":"세 · 岁","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64008-1-9-1","ko":"죄송하지만, 나이가 어찌 되시는지요.","zh":"不好意思，请问您多大年纪呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송하지만,","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송하지만","audio":"/audio/8f5e03e932bf717d558b.mp3"}},{"text":"나이가","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나이가","audio":"/audio/61d19a9f3b9c5119f3e9.mp3"}},{"text":"어찌","meaning":"怎么","explanation":"어찌：怎么","readings":[{"term":"어찌","audio":"/audio/268446ad774e9ad8067a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24032","senseId":"2","lemma":"어찌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어찌","audio":"/audio/268446ad774e9ad8067a.mp3"}},{"text":"되시는지요.","meaning":"为","explanation":"되다：为；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；는지요：以礼貌、委婉的语气询问信息。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"5","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되시는지요","audio":"/audio/d011a2c0b2fcc0183fdb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"268446ad774e9ad8","term":"어찌","zh":"怎么","audio":"/audio/268446ad774e9ad8067a.mp3","entryId":"24032","definition":"以什么办法；或指以什么方式。","pro